001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.     TMAINVEN.
001300 AUTHOR.         BARBARA WINTER.
001400*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.   MARCH 31, 1987.
001600*REMARKS.
001700*  FRONT-END PROGRAM THAT CALLS EITHER AKRON OR PLANT VERSION
001800*  OF QUOTE PROGRAM.  THIS ELIMINATES THE NEED FOR DIFFERENT NAMED
001900*  OBJECTS AND THE UDC'S CAN NOW RUN THE SAME PROGRAM.
002000
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
002500 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS MPLTINFO-STATUS.

005800 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

002800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  MPLTINFO-STATUS           PIC X(2).
007100 01  PLANT-TYPE                PIC 9        VALUE ZERO.
007200     88  AKRON                              VALUE 1.
015700 01  MPLTINFO-ARG              PIC X(4)     VALUE "P 01".
       COPY MPLTINFO OF COPYCSIS.
004000
004100 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
004200 00-MAIN.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY  OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 0 TO PLANT-TYPE.
033700     IF MPLTINFO-COMP-1-2 = "11"
033800        MOVE 1 TO PLANT-TYPE
033900     ELSE
034000        MOVE 0 TO PLANT-TYPE.
004300*----------  IS THIS AKRON OR PLANT?
004700     IF AKRON
004800        CALL "TAKRQUOT"
004900     ELSE
005000        CALL "TUDCQUOT".
005100
005200     GOBACK.
